{"id":"n62273-1-10","stage":1,"title":"부엌 · 厨房","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62273-1-10-1","ko":"언니, 엄마는 어디 계셔?","zh":"姐姐，妈妈在哪儿呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언니,","meaning":"姐姐，大姐","explanation":"언니：姐姐，大姐","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"3","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엄마는","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계셔?","meaning":"(尊称)身份高的人或长辈正在某个地方。","explanation":"계시다：(尊称)身份高的人或长辈正在某个地方。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"계시다","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17749","senseId":"2","lemma":"계시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐，大姐","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于亲切地指称或称呼比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"e0bef9809d26f11e","term":"계시다","zh":"(尊称)身份高的人或长辈正在某个地方。","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3","entryId":"17749","definition":"(尊称)身份高的人或长辈正在某个地方。","pronunciation":["계ː시다","게ː시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1ba579df3631e1814627.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62273-1-10-2","ko":"부엌에서 요리하고 계셔.","zh":"她在厨房做饭